  CellName: Astro League
  Description: Hypersea-soccer arena cell with a trail-grazing food web — fauna spawn
    in the controlling color and the forager crew grazes any-domain trail. The nucleus here
    is the ricochet COURT, declared play geometry rather than a control zone, so the pitch is
    edible at all; the crew waits outside the court and is released when the volume ladder
    leaves Calm. See Docs/ECOSYSTEM.md §25.
